WEBVTT

00:14:58.796 --> 00:15:02.356
"The reason why we don't have these things
in this book is because of men."

00:15:02.356 --> 00:15:03.756
No, it's not because of men.

00:15:03.796 --> 00:15:06.076
You know what I mean,
that's not the problem.

00:15:06.116 --> 00:15:09.796
It's because of the power

00:15:09.836 --> 00:15:13.716
and the way that we've traditionally
created workplaces.

00:15:13.716 --> 00:15:18.196
So you also then, when you talk to people
who you think are not your allies

00:15:18.236 --> 00:15:21.316
or who you think may be against you,
you sometimes are surprised.

00:15:21.316 --> 00:15:23.596
I mean, it's the same thing
with Girls Who Code,

00:15:23.636 --> 00:15:25.756
it's like, 40 percent
of my teachers are men.

00:15:25.796 --> 00:15:27.596
So that's how you build movements.

00:15:28.316 --> 00:15:32.276
And for me as a social entrepreneur
building my second movement, you know,